What type of fruit would be a good addition to a fruit salad?A good addition to a fruit salad is a variety of sweet and juicy fruits such as strawberries, blueberries, kiwis, pineapples, mangoes, bananas or grapes. Adding some citrus fruits such as oranges or grapefruit can add a little zesty flavor. Trying different combinations of fruits can help you find the perfect mix for your fruit salad.
Describe in a few words what makes a good leader.A good leader is someone who possesses qualities such as integrity, clear vision, strong communication skills, empathy, decisiveness and the ability to inspire and motivate others towards a common goal.
