Write a definition for the term "machine learning".Machine learning is a branch of artificial intelligence that refers to the development of algorithms and statistical models that allow computer systems to improve their performance on a specific task over time by using data and experience, rather than explicit programming. The algorithms use patterns and inference from the data to learn from experience and make predictions or decisions without being explicitly programmed to carry out the task. Machine learning applications include computer vision, natural language processing, speech recognition, and recommendation systems, among others.
