Generate a creative activity for a child to do during their summer vacation.One creative activity for a child to do during their summer vacation is to create a nature journal. To start, they will need a blank notebook or sketchbook and some art supplies such as colored pencils, crayons or watercolors. Encourage the child to go outside and explore their surroundings. They can take a walk in the park, go for a hike or just explore their own backyard.

