Identify 3 ways to improve customer service.1. Listening attentively and empathizing with customers: It’s crucial that customer service representatives actively listen to the customers and empathize with their concerns in order to both understand their needs and build better relationships. Being attentive also means taking the time to ask questions and clarify any misunderstandings to ensure that they are fully understanding the problem at hand.

