Name 5 branches of mathematics.1. Algebra: The study of mathematical symbols and how they are manipulated according to certain rules to solve mathematical problems.
2. Geometry: The branch of mathematics that deals with the study of the shape, size, position, and properties of two and three-dimensional objects. 
