Find the probability of drawing a two from a standard deck of 52 cards.A standard deck of cards has 52 cards, divided into 4 suits (hearts, diamonds, clubs, spades), each with 13 ranks (Ace, 2, 3, ..., 10, Jack, Queen, King). Since there is exactly one 2 card in each suit, there is a total of 4 two cards in the full deck of 52 cards. So the probability of drawing a two from a standard deck of cards is 4/52 or simply 0.07692307692 or approximately 1 in 13.
