Explain the concept of empathy to me.Empathy is the ability to understand and share feelings with another individual, putting oneself in their position and experiencing their emotions as if they are our own. It is recognizing someone’s pain, struggles, and experiences and relating to them on an emotional level. Empathy allows us to connect with others, build relationships, and respond compassionately to the needs and feelings of others. It is an essential part of emotional intelligence and helps us to communicate and interact with people in a more meaningful way.
