Write a script for a one-minute skit(Scene: A messy room with clothes and books scattered all over the floor. A person, Emma, is frantically searching for something.)

Emma: (Sighing) Ugh, where did I put my keys? I’m already late for my appointment! 

AI Assistant: (voiceover) Emma, it looks like you’re having trouble finding your keys. Would you like me to help you locate them?

Emma: (starts) Oh, yeah please! I’m so stressed out right now.

AI Assistant: (voiceover) Don’t worry, Emma. According to my recent scans of the room, your keys are under that pile of clothes near the bed.

Emma: (moves to the bed and lifts up a pile of clothes) Ah ha! Yes, there they are! Thank you so much. I would have been late for sure.

AI Assistant: (voiceover) It was my pleasure to assist you, Emma. Just a reminder, your appointment is in 30 minutes.

Emma: That’s right! I should hurry up. Thanks again, AI assistant.

AI Assistant: (voiceover) You’re welcome, Emma. Take care and have a great day!

(Emma exits the room, turning off the light as she leaves. The room is now neat as the AI has tidied it up.)

AI Assistant: (voiceover) Goodbye, Emma!

(End of scene)
