Generate an innovative idea for a product to help people reduce stress.One idea for an innovative product to help people reduce stress could be a smart stress ball that connects to a mobile app. The stress ball would have various sensors and pressure points built-in that detect and track the user's squeezing patterns, hand grips, and intensity levels. The corresponding mobile app would then generate personalized stress relief programs, such as breathing exercises, meditation techniques, and hand exercises, based on the data collected from the user’s squeeze patterns.

The app would also provide insights on the user's stress levels and trigger points, helping them to better understand and manage their stress. Additionally, the app could include features such as daily stress level tracking, customizable notifications, and reminders to take a break and perform stress-relieving exercises.

This product would provide a convenient, portable, and personalized solution for people looking to reduce and manage their stress levels, whether at home, work or on-the-go.
