2. Timeframe - This category specifies the time frame within which the action will take place or be completed, In this case, it is tomorrow.
3. Personal Pronoun - This category indicates that the sentence is from the first-person perspective, using the personal pronoun "I" to identify the speaker as the person who will finish the report.
