Provide two measures to reduce stress.1. Exercise: Regular physical activity can help lower stress levels by releasing endorphins, which are natural mood-boosters. Additionally, exercise can also serve as a healthy distraction, helping take your mind off of stressful situations and allowing you to refocus your energy in a positive way.

