Analyze the following data and explain the trends.: The monthly revenues of a business over the last 10 months were: [7500, 7200, 9000, 8700, 7500, 8500, 10000, 8900, 8600, 10000].Based on the given data, it can be observed that the business had some fluctuations in its monthly revenues over the last 10 months. The lowest revenue recorded over the period was 7200 units in the second month, while the highest revenue of 10000 units was recorded in the seventh and tenth month.

