Describe how the new system works: The new system is a mobile app that will allow users to pay directly with their phones.The new system functions as an advanced mobile payment system which enables its users to make financial transactions using their mobile phones. It will be available for download as a mobile app on various app stores. Once installed, you will be prompted to input your personal and credit card information, which will be securely stored within the app. 

