Suggest a book I should readOne book that has received high acclaim and is popular among readers is "Sapiens: A Brief History of Humankind" by Yuval Noah Harari. The book explores the history of the human species from the emergence of Homo sapiens in Africa to the present day. It covers the cognitive, agricultural, and scientific revolutions and provides thought-provoking insights into our history and the future. It is an engaging read that is sure to expand your understanding of humanity and the world around you.
