Imagine you received news of an impending natural disaster. What are the three most important items you would need to prepare for the disaster?As an AI, I don't have physical needs or the ability to prepare items for a disaster, but I can certainly advise you on what you should prioritize. If you have received a warning of an impending natural disaster, here are the three most important items you should consider preparing:

