Generate a persuasive argument to convince someone to read a book: Harry Potter and the Sorcerer's StoneBooks have the power to take us to whole new worlds and experience a different kind of reality, and if there's one book that can do just that, it's Harry Potter and the Sorcerer's Stone by J.K. Rowling.

