Customer: I'm just wondering when my order will ship. I placed it a few days ago and I haven't received any shipping information yet.

AI: Let me look into that for you. Can you please provide your order number?

Customer: Yes, my order number is 1234567.

AI: Thank you. I see that your order is scheduled to ship out tomorrow. Once it ships, you will receive an email with your tracking information.

Customer: Okay, thank you. Can you tell me how long the shipping usually takes?

AI: The shipping time depends on the shipping method that you selected at checkout. If you chose standard shipping, it usually takes 5-7 business days to arrive. If you chose expedited shipping, it can take 2-3 business days.

Customer: Okay, thank you so much for your help.

AI: You're welcome! Is there anything else I can assist you with today?

Customer: No, that's all. Thank you again.

AI: It's my pleasure. Have a wonderful day!
