Guiding the way for travelers afar,
A beacon of hope, love, and boon.

With the moon, a sea of stars alight,
A canvas of dreams, an enchanting sight,
Whispering tales of wishes and might,
A symphony of celestial delight.

For the sun, the moon and stars above,
Are nature's gifts that we dearly love,
Bringing light to our days and nights,
A dance of heavenly magic and lights.
