Cite a particular piece of evidence to support the sentence: Violent video games have been proven to increase aggressive behaviorOne particular piece of evidence to support the statement that violent video games increase aggressive behavior is a study conducted by the National Center for Health Research in 2019. The study found that playing violent video games can "increase aggressive behavior, including physical fighting and verbal aggression" as well as "decrease prosocial behavior, including helping others and showing empathy" (National Center for Health Research, 2019).

