Moreover, the location and site design of the housing can be chosen with sustainability in mind, such as by preserving natural habitats and minimizing disruption to local ecosystems. Finally, educating residents about sustainable living practices and providing them with resources to reduce waste and conserve water, energy and other resources can also contribute to more sustainable housing.
