Create a css stylesheet to increase font size to 20px, give all text italicized font-style and apply 70% transparency to all elements.Here is a CSS stylesheet that increases the font size to 20px, applies an italicized font style, and adds 70% transparency to all elements on the page:

```css
body {
    font-size: 20px;
