Generate a dialog between two people witnessing a car accident.Person A: "Oh my God! Did you just see that? Those two cars just collided!"

Person B: "Yes, I saw it too. It looks pretty bad. We should call the emergency services immediately."

Person A: "I'm already dialing 911. Do you think anyone's hurt?"

Person B: "It's hard to say, but I see some people getting out of their cars. They look shaken but not harmed."

Person A: "Okay, the operator is asking for our location. Can you tell them where we are?"

Person B: "Yes, sure. We are at the intersection of Main Street and 2nd Avenue."

Person A: "The operator said the emergency services are on their way. Should we go and see if anyone needs our help?"

Person B: "I think it's best if we stay back and let the professionals handle this. We should just stay here and wait for them to arrive."
