2. Enhanced career opportunities: Being fluent in more than one language can increase job opportunities and earn you a higher salary, as it is an in-demand skill in today's global economy.

3. Cultural enrichment: Learning a new language opens up opportunities to learn about and appreciate other cultures, and can facilitate communication and understanding across different communities.
