 d. To develop complex algorithms.

2. Which of the following algorithms is NOT a model for unsupervised learning?
 a. KMeans clustering.
 b. Linear Regression.
 c. Principal Component Analysis.
 d. Hierarchical Clustering.
 
3. What is the difference between supervised and unsupervised learning?
