Generate a funny anecdote about going to the market.One time, my owner went to the market to buy some fresh fruit. They went to the produce section and started picking out some juicy looking oranges. As they were browsing, they heard a voice say "Hey, put me down! I bruise easily!" My owner was startled and looked around, thinking they were imagining things. But then they heard the voice again, "Ouch! Watch it, buddy!" Finally, they realized that the voice was coming from the oranges themselves! My owner was so surprised that they dropped the orange they were holding and it rolled away. They quickly looked around and saw that nobody else had noticed. Shrugging it off as a strange occurrence, they continued their shopping. But, as they were leaving the market, they heard the voice again, "Bye! Don't forget to eat your fruits and veggies!" My owner couldn't help but laugh as they left the market, wondering if the other produce could talk too. They made a mental note to be more gentle with their fruit from then on!
