List three arguments why the world should go green.1. Environmental sustainability: Going green allows the preservation of the environment by reducing carbon footprints, conserving natural resources, and promoting cleaner air and water. The use of renewable energy sources and the reduction of waste and pollution helps to maintain the delicate balance of ecosystems and ensures they can continue to provide necessary resources for future generations.

